note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note Pure seeded OM-2 port of the hook wiring of tools/omega.c (visor_console_default_ops,
note omega_tool_session_init, omega_tool_open_script). The ONE place where the console's
note hooks reach the other lanes. Nothing here mints capabilities, publishes or submits
note effects: the only execution path is the realization lane's run_pure, reached only
note after the classifier (vom_classify) says the subject is pure.
note Hook bodies go to vb_*, messages to ve_* (visor_console_hooks.om).
note Realization and verify are reached only through the vom_rl_* / vom_vf_* adapters below.

